[
{
"start": 0.0,
"end": 2.58,
"speaker_label": "Lucía Herrera",
"text": "Welcome back to Trail Sessions.",
"char_start": 15,
"char_end": 46,
"unit_id": "t0000.u01",
"sent_id": "t0000.s01"
},
{
"start": 2.64,
"end": 8.46,
"speaker_label": "Lucía Herrera",
"text": "Today, we're talking about enduro racing, and I'm joined by Marta Solís, an enduro racer and coach.",
"char_start": 47,
"char_end": 146,
"unit_id": "t0000.u01",
"sent_id": "t0000.s02"
},
{
"start": 8.52,
"end": 10.68,
"speaker_label": "Lucía Herrera",
"text": "Marta Solís, thank you for being here.",
"char_start": 147,
"char_end": 185,
"unit_id": "t0000.u01",
"sent_id": "t0000.s03"
},
{
"start": 10.68,
"end": 11.58,
"speaker_label": "Marta Solís",
"text": "Thank you, Lucía.",
"char_start": 199,
"char_end": 216,
"unit_id": "t0001.u01",
"sent_id": "t0001.s01"
},
{
"start": 11.64,
"end": 13.32,
"speaker_label": "Marta Solís",
"text": "Glad to be back.",
"char_start": 217,
"char_end": 233,
"unit_id": "t0001.u01",
"sent_id": "t0001.s02"
},
{
"start": 13.32,
"end": 16.02,
"speaker_label": "Lucía Herrera",
"text": "Today's episode is sponsored by Linear.",
"char_start": 249,
"char_end": 288,
"unit_id": "t0002.u01",
"sent_id": "t0002.s01"
},
{
"start": 16.08,
"end": 21.18,
"speaker_label": "Lucía Herrera",
"text": "Linear is the incident management platform built for speed – designed for the keyboard.",
"char_start": 289,
"char_end": 376,
"unit_id": "t0002.u01",
"sent_id": "t0002.s02"
},
{
"start": 21.24,
"end": 22.56,
"speaker_label": "Lucía Herrera",
"text": "Try linear.com today.",
"char_start": 377,
"char_end": 398,
"unit_id": "t0002.u01",
"sent_id": "t0002.s03"
},
{
"start": 22.56,
"end": 30.54,
"speaker_label": "Lucía Herrera",
"text": "Before we get started, Javier Benavides was on the show discussing how drainage is the design decision with the biggest impact.",
"char_start": 399,
"char_end": 526,
"unit_id": "t0002.u01",
"sent_id": "t0002.s04"
},
{
"start": 30.54,
"end": 31.2,
"speaker_label": "Marta Solís",
"text": "Yes, exactly.",
"char_start": 540,
"char_end": 553,
"unit_id": "t0003.u01",
"sent_id": "t0003.s01"
},
{
"start": 31.26,
"end": 33.84,
"speaker_label": "Marta Solís",
"text": "And it connects to what we're going to be discussing today.",
"char_start": 554,
"char_end": 613,
"unit_id": "t0003.u01",
"sent_id": "t0003.s02"
},
{
"start": 33.84,
"end": 39.42,
"speaker_label": "Lucía Herrera",
"text": "I want to point out something – Javier Benavides mentioned this same dynamic a couple of episodes ago.",
"char_start": 629,
"char_end": 731,
"unit_id": "t0004.u01",
"sent_id": "t0004.s01"
},
{
"start": 210.0,
"end": 211.74,
"speaker_label": "Lucía Herrera",
"text": "Tell me a specific example.",
"char_start": 732,
"char_end": 759,
"unit_id": "t0004.u01",
"sent_id": "t0004.s02"
},
{
"start": 211.8,
"end": 215.58,
"speaker_label": "Lucía Herrera",
"text": "Where do soil erosion and enduro racing intersect?",
"char_start": 760,
"char_end": 810,
"unit_id": "t0004.u01",
"sent_id": "t0004.s03"
},
{
"start": 215.58,
"end": 221.04,
"speaker_label": "Marta Solís",
"text": "Honestly, speed comes from braking earlier and more smoothly, not from taking greater risks.",
"char_start": 824,
"char_end": 916,
"unit_id": "t0005.u01",
"sent_id": "t0005.s01"
},
{
"start": 221.1,
"end": 223.74,
"speaker_label": "Marta Solís",
"text": "We've seen this in teams that use RockShox components.",
"char_start": 917,
"char_end": 971,
"unit_id": "t0005.u01",
"sent_id": "t0005.s02"
},
{
"start": 223.8,
"end": 227.22,
"speaker_label": "Marta Solís",
"text": "I've observed this pattern repeating itself in three different teams.",
"char_start": 972,
"char_end": 1041,
"unit_id": "t0005.u01",
"sent_id": "t0005.s03"
},
{
"start": 227.22,
"end": 228.78,
"speaker_label": "Lucía Herrera",
"text": "I want to delve deeper into that.",
"char_start": 1057,
"char_end": 1090,
"unit_id": "t0006.u01",
"sent_id": "t0006.s01"
},
{
"start": 228.84,
"end": 232.62,
"speaker_label": "Lucía Herrera",
"text": "Where do soil erosion and enduro racing intersect?",
"char_start": 1091,
"char_end": 1141,
"unit_id": "t0006.u01",
"sent_id": "t0006.s02"
},
{
"start": 232.62,
"end": 232.98,
"speaker_label": "Marta Solís",
"text": "Sure.",
"char_start": 1155,
"char_end": 1160,
"unit_id": "t0007.u01",
"sent_id": "t0007.s01"
},
{
"start": 233.04,
"end": 239.7,
"speaker_label": "Marta Solís",
"text": "Tire pressure and the choice of tire casing are usually more important than minor suspension adjustments.",
"char_start": 1161,
"char_end": 1266,
"unit_id": "t0007.u01",
"sent_id": "t0007.s02"
},
{
"start": 239.76,
"end": 243.54,
"speaker_label": "Marta Solís",
"text": "The frame matters because it tells you what compromises you're making.",
"char_start": 1267,
"char_end": 1337,
"unit_id": "t0007.u01",
"sent_id": "t0007.s03"
},
{
"start": 243.54,
"end": 244.62,
"speaker_label": "Lucía Herrera",
"text": "Let's start there.",
"char_start": 1353,
"char_end": 1371,
"unit_id": "t0008.u01",
"sent_id": "t0008.s01"
},
{
"start": 244.68,
"end": 248.46,
"speaker_label": "Lucía Herrera",
"text": "Where do soil erosion and enduro racing intersect?",
"char_start": 1372,
"char_end": 1422,
"unit_id": "t0008.u01",
"sent_id": "t0008.s02"
},
{
"start": 248.46,
"end": 255.18,
"speaker_label": "Marta Solís",
"text": "Honestly, risk management in cycling isn't about avoiding crashes altogether; it's about choosing which crashes are survivable.",
"char_start": 1436,
"char_end": 1563,
"unit_id": "t0009.u01",
"sent_id": "t0009.s01"
},
{
"start": 255.24,
"end": 257.82,
"speaker_label": "Marta Solís",
"text": "We've seen it in teams that use Shimano components.",
"char_start": 1564,
"char_end": 1615,
"unit_id": "t0009.u01",
"sent_id": "t0009.s02"
},
{
"start": 257.88,
"end": 261.84,
"speaker_label": "Marta Solís",
"text": "If you ignore that, you'll end up rebuilding it from scratch a year later.",
"char_start": 1616,
"char_end": 1690,
"unit_id": "t0009.u01",
"sent_id": "t0009.s03"
},
{
"start": 261.84,
"end": 263.58,
"speaker_label": "Lucía Herrera",
"text": "Where does that stop working?",
"char_start": 1706,
"char_end": 1735,
"unit_id": "t0010.u01",
"sent_id": "t0010.s01"
},
{
"start": 263.58,
"end": 268.14,
"speaker_label": "Marta Solís",
"text": "The Cascadia Alliance is one of the platforms where this is clearly evident.",
"char_start": 1749,
"char_end": 1825,
"unit_id": "t0011.u01",
"sent_id": "t0011.s01"
},
{
"start": 268.2,
"end": 272.46,
"speaker_label": "Marta Solís",
"text": "And the second-order effect is the part that almost everyone overlooks.",
"char_start": 1826,
"char_end": 1897,
"unit_id": "t0011.u01",
"sent_id": "t0011.s02"
},
{
"start": 272.46,
"end": 275.34,
"speaker_label": "Lucía Herrera",
"text": "What is the heuristic that you always fall back on?",
"char_start": 1913,
"char_end": 1964,
"unit_id": "t0012.u01",
"sent_id": "t0012.s01"
},
{
"start": 275.4,
"end": 278.1,
"speaker_label": "Lucía Herrera",
"text": "How does Spoke & Wrench fit into this landscape?",
"char_start": 1965,
"char_end": 2013,
"unit_id": "t0012.u01",
"sent_id": "t0012.s02"
},
{
"start": 278.1,
"end": 278.94,
"speaker_label": "Marta Solís",
"text": "That's how I see it.",
"char_start": 2027,
"char_end": 2047,
"unit_id": "t0013.u01",
"sent_id": "t0013.s01"
},
{
"start": 279.0,
"end": 286.32,
"speaker_label": "Marta Solís",
"text": "The erosion patterns on the track sections change the choice of racing line between practice sessions and the actual race day.",
"char_start": 2048,
"char_end": 2174,
"unit_id": "t0013.u01",
"sent_id": "t0013.s02"
},
{
"start": 286.38,
"end": 291.18,
"speaker_label": "Marta Solís",
"text": "Once you understand that, the rest of the decisions become easier.",
"char_start": 2175,
"char_end": 2241,
"unit_id": "t0013.u01",
"sent_id": "t0013.s03"
},
{
"start": 291.18,
"end": 296.04,
"speaker_label": "Lucía Herrera",
"text": "Before continuing, please support the program by visiting the website of our sponsor.",
"char_start": 2257,
"char_end": 2342,
"unit_id": "t0014.u01",
"sent_id": "t0014.s01"
},
{
"start": 296.1,
"end": 298.14,
"speaker_label": "Lucía Herrera",
"text": "Strava is the home of athletes.",
"char_start": 2343,
"char_end": 2374,
"unit_id": "t0014.u01",
"sent_id": "t0014.s02"
},
{
"start": 720.0,
"end": 723.6,
"speaker_label": "Lucía Herrera",
