"text": "Welcome back to the program.",
"char_start": 2600,
"char_end": 2628,
"unit_id": "t0016.u01",
"sent_id": "t0016.s01"
},
{
"start": 840.0,
"end": 841.56,
"speaker_label": "Lucía Herrera",
"text": "I want to delve deeper into that.",
"char_start": 2629,
"char_end": 2662,
"unit_id": "t0016.u01",
"sent_id": "t0016.s02"
},
{
"start": 841.62,
"end": 845.04,
"speaker_label": "Lucía Herrera",
"text": "What is the version of the question that truly matters?",
"char_start": 2663,
"char_end": 2718,
"unit_id": "t0016.u01",
"sent_id": "t0016.s03"
},
{
"start": 845.04,
"end": 847.62,
"speaker_label": "Marta Solís",
"text": "Let me give you the version that I truly believe in.",
"char_start": 2732,
"char_end": 2784,
"unit_id": "t0017.u01",
"sent_id": "t0017.s01"
},
{
"start": 847.68,
"end": 852.3,
"speaker_label": "Marta Solís",
"text": "Speed comes from braking earlier and more smoothly, not from taking greater risks.",
"char_start": 2785,
"char_end": 2867,
"unit_id": "t0017.u01",
"sent_id": "t0017.s02"
},
{
"start": 852.36,
"end": 855.0,
"speaker_label": "Marta Solís",
"text": "We've seen this in teams that use RockShox.",
"char_start": 2868,
"char_end": 2911,
"unit_id": "t0017.u01",
"sent_id": "t0017.s03"
},
{
"start": 855.06,
"end": 859.32,
"speaker_label": "Marta Solís",
"text": "And the secondary effect is the part that almost everyone overlooks.",
"char_start": 2912,
"char_end": 2980,
"unit_id": "t0017.u01",
"sent_id": "t0017.s04"
},
{
"start": 859.32,
"end": 861.06,
"speaker_label": "Lucía Herrera",
"text": "What does the failure mode look like?",
"char_start": 2996,
"char_end": 3033,
"unit_id": "t0018.u01",
"sent_id": "t0018.s01"
},
{
"start": 861.12,
"end": 865.8,
"speaker_label": "Lucía Herrera",
"text": "What is the operating angle that most listeners do not have access to?",
"char_start": 3034,
"char_end": 3104,
"unit_id": "t0018.u01",
"sent_id": "t0018.s02"
},
{
"start": 865.8,
"end": 873.12,
"speaker_label": "Marta Solís",
"text": "Yes, look – tire pressure and the choice of tire casing often matter more than a minor suspension adjustment.",
"char_start": 3118,
"char_end": 3227,
"unit_id": "t0019.u01",
"sent_id": "t0019.s01"
},
{
"start": 873.18,
"end": 876.96,
"speaker_label": "Marta Solís",
"text": "The frame matters because it tells you what compromises you're making.",
"char_start": 3228,
"char_end": 3298,
"unit_id": "t0019.u01",
"sent_id": "t0019.s02"
},
{
"start": 876.96,
"end": 878.7,
"speaker_label": "Lucía Herrera",
"text": "Tell me a specific example.",
"char_start": 3314,
"char_end": 3341,
"unit_id": "t0020.u01",
"sent_id": "t0020.s01"
},
{
"start": 878.76,
"end": 882.18,
"speaker_label": "Lucía Herrera",
"text": "What is the version of the question that truly matters?",
"char_start": 3342,
"char_end": 3397,
"unit_id": "t0020.u01",
"sent_id": "t0020.s02"
},
{
"start": 882.18,
"end": 888.72,
"speaker_label": "Marta Solís",
"text": "Yes, look – risk management in cycling isn't about avoiding crashes; it's about choosing which crashes are survivable.",
"char_start": 3411,
"char_end": 3529,
"unit_id": "t0021.u01",
"sent_id": "t0021.s01"
},
{
"start": 888.78,
"end": 891.42,
"speaker_label": "Marta Solís",
"text": "We've seen this in teams that use RockShox components.",
"char_start": 3530,
"char_end": 3584,
"unit_id": "t0021.u01",
"sent_id": "t0021.s02"
},
{
"start": 891.48,
"end": 894.9,
"speaker_label": "Marta Solís",
"text": "I've seen this pattern repeat itself in three different teams.",
"char_start": 3585,
"char_end": 3647,
"unit_id": "t0021.u01",
"sent_id": "t0021.s03"
},
{
"start": 894.9,
"end": 896.4,
"speaker_label": "Lucía Herrera",
"text": "Tell me more about that.",
"char_start": 3663,
