"sent_id": "t0022.s01"
},
{
"start": 896.4,
"end": 900.96,
"speaker_label": "Marta Solís",
"text": "The Cascadia Alliance is one of the platforms where this is clearly evident.",
"char_start": 3701,
"char_end": 3777,
"unit_id": "t0023.u01",
"sent_id": "t0023.s01"
},
{
"start": 901.02,
"end": 905.82,
"speaker_label": "Marta Solís",
"text": "Once you understand that, the rest of the decisions become easier.",
"char_start": 3778,
"char_end": 3844,
"unit_id": "t0023.u01",
"sent_id": "t0023.s02"
},
{
"start": 905.82,
"end": 906.9,
"speaker_label": "Lucía Herrera",
"text": "Let's start with that.",
"char_start": 3860,
"char_end": 3882,
"unit_id": "t0024.u01",
"sent_id": "t0024.s01"
},
{
"start": 906.96,
"end": 910.68,
"speaker_label": "Lucía Herrera",
"text": "What is the most underestimated aspect of enduro racing?",
"char_start": 3883,
"char_end": 3939,
"unit_id": "t0024.u01",
"sent_id": "t0024.s02"
},
{
"start": 910.68,
"end": 919.08,
"speaker_label": "Marta Solís",
"text": "It boils down to this: the erosion patterns on the track sections change the optimal racing line between practice sessions and the actual race day.",
"char_start": 3953,
"char_end": 4100,
"unit_id": "t0025.u01",
"sent_id": "t0025.s01"
},
{
"start": 919.14,
"end": 922.56,
"speaker_label": "Marta Solís",
"text": "I've seen this pattern repeat itself in three different teams.",
"char_start": 4101,
"char_end": 4163,
"unit_id": "t0025.u01",
"sent_id": "t0025.s02"
},
{
"start": 1320.0,
"end": 1324.5,
"speaker_label": "Lucía Herrera",
"text": "Let's change the subject – I want to dedicate the final part to risk management.",
"char_start": 4179,
"char_end": 4259,
"unit_id": "t0026.u01",
"sent_id": "t0026.s01"
},
{
"start": 1324.5,
"end": 1333.26,
"speaker_label": "Marta Solís",
"text": "That's where the conversation gets interesting, because the considerations surrounding risk management permeate everything we've discussed.",
"char_start": 4273,
"char_end": 4412,
"unit_id": "t0027.u01",
"sent_id": "t0027.s01"
},
{
"start": 1333.26,
"end": 1335.0,
"speaker_label": "Lucía Herrera",
"text": "What does the failure mode look like?",
"char_start": 4428,
"char_end": 4465,
"unit_id": "t0028.u01",
"sent_id": "t0028.s01"
},
{
"start": 1335.06,
"end": 1339.74,
"speaker_label": "Lucía Herrera",
"text": "What is the opposite perspective that most listeners don't have access to?",
"char_start": 4466,
"char_end": 4540,
"unit_id": "t0028.u01",
"sent_id": "t0028.s02"
},
{
"start": 1339.74,
"end": 1340.1,
"speaker_label": "Marta Solís",
"text": "Sure.",
"char_start": 4554,
"char_end": 4559,
"unit_id": "t0029.u01",
"sent_id": "t0029.s01"
},
{
"start": 1340.16,
"end": 1344.78,
"speaker_label": "Marta Solís",
"text": "The speed comes from braking earlier and more smoothly, not from taking greater risks.",
"char_start": 4560,
"char_end": 4646,
"unit_id": "t0029.u01",
"sent_id": "t0029.s02"
},
{
"start": 1344.84,
