"char_end": 5146,
"unit_id": "t0032.u01",
"sent_id": "t0032.s02"
},
{
"start": 1372.5,
"end": 1375.08,
"speaker_label": "Marta Solís",
"text": "Let me give you the version that I truly believe in.",
"char_start": 5160,
"char_end": 5212,
"unit_id": "t0033.u01",
"sent_id": "t0033.s01"
},
{
"start": 1375.14,
"end": 1381.02,
"speaker_label": "Marta Solís",
"text": "Risk management in a career isn't about avoiding falls; it's about choosing which falls are survivable.",
"char_start": 5213,
"char_end": 5316,
"unit_id": "t0033.u01",
"sent_id": "t0033.s02"
},
{
"start": 1381.08,
"end": 1384.08,
"speaker_label": "Marta Solís",
"text": "We've seen this with teams that use Spoke & Wrench.",
"char_start": 5317,
"char_end": 5368,
"unit_id": "t0033.u01",
"sent_id": "t0033.s03"
},
{
"start": 1384.14,
"end": 1387.56,
"speaker_label": "Marta Solís",
"text": "I've seen this pattern repeat itself in three different teams.",
"char_start": 5369,
"char_end": 5431,
"unit_id": "t0033.u01",
"sent_id": "t0033.s04"
},
{
"start": 1387.56,
"end": 1389.06,
"speaker_label": "Lucía Herrera",
"text": "That makes sense.",
"char_start": 5447,
"char_end": 5464,
"unit_id": "t0034.u01",
"sent_id": "t0034.s01"
},
{
"start": 1389.06,
"end": 1397.94,
"speaker_label": "Marta Solís",
"text": "And when teams adopt Spoke & Wrench within that workflow, the benefit becomes clear – I've seen this pattern repeat itself in three different teams.",
"char_start": 5478,
"char_end": 5626,
"unit_id": "t0035.u01",
"sent_id": "t0035.s01"
},
{
"start": 1397.94,
"end": 1400.82,
"speaker_label": "Lucía Herrera",
"text": "What is the heuristic that you always fall back on?",
"char_start": 5642,
"char_end": 5693,
"unit_id": "t0036.u01",
"sent_id": "t0036.s01"
},
{
"start": 1400.88,
"end": 1404.3,
"speaker_label": "Lucía Herrera",
"text": "What is the version of the question that truly matters?",
"char_start": 5694,
"char_end": 5749,
"unit_id": "t0036.u01",
"sent_id": "t0036.s02"
},
{
"start": 1404.3,
"end": 1405.14,
"speaker_label": "Marta Solís",
"text": "That's how I see it.",
"char_start": 5763,
"char_end": 5783,
"unit_id": "t0037.u01",
"sent_id": "t0037.s01"
},
{
"start": 1405.2,
"end": 1412.52,
"speaker_label": "Marta Solís",
"text": "The erosion patterns on the track sections change the choice of racing line between practice sessions and the actual race day.",
"char_start": 5784,
"char_end": 5910,
"unit_id": "t0037.u01",
"sent_id": "t0037.s02"
},
{
"start": 1412.58,
"end": 1416.0,
"speaker_label": "Marta Solís",
"text": "I've seen this pattern repeat itself in three different teams.",
"char_start": 5911,
"char_end": 5973,
"unit_id": "t0037.u01",
"sent_id": "t0037.s03"
},
{
"start": 1680.0,
"end": 1684.68,
"speaker_label": "Lucía Herrera",
"text": "Before we wrap up, what's one thing that listeners can try out this week?",
"char_start": 5989,
"char_end": 6062,
"unit_id": "t0038.u01",
"sent_id": "t0038.s01"
},
{
"start": 1684.68,
"end": 1688.7,
